WEBVTT

00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:31.370
Hey, you there?

00:00:38.540 --> 00:00:40.000
What's this?

00:00:42.290 --> 00:00:45.160
Hey, now. Stop that.

00:00:49.250 --> 00:00:50.750
Is it good?

00:00:50.750 --> 00:00:54.540
I don't really get that kind of thing.

00:00:54.540 --> 00:00:56.540
Oh, he's really here.

00:00:58.790 --> 00:01:01.370
See? Didn't I tell you?

00:01:04.660 --> 00:01:07.660
Why haven't you been coming
to the arcade lately?

00:01:07.660 --> 00:01:09.870
It's lonely without you, Belo.

00:01:09.870 --> 00:01:12.410
Did you join another team?

00:01:12.410 --> 00:01:14.160
How'd you find me?

00:01:14.160 --> 00:01:15.250
Sorry.

00:01:15.250 --> 00:01:19.080
I happened to see you here
a little while back.

00:01:19.080 --> 00:01:22.250
I get it. I still have some food left.

00:03:18.450 --> 00:03:20.500
Hey! Hey! How about this?

00:03:20.500 --> 00:03:22.580
Isn't that a bit too flashy?

00:03:22.580 --> 00:03:24.830
No. It'll look good on you!

00:03:24.830 --> 00:03:26.910
Isn't that one better?

00:03:26.910 --> 00:03:29.040
Annie, what do you think?

00:03:29.040 --> 00:03:32.620
Annie?

00:03:29.040 --> 00:03:32.620
Huh? Oh... Yeah.

00:03:32.620 --> 00:03:35.450
I was wondering about that strange dog.

00:03:35.450 --> 00:03:38.040
Oh, it's a hybrid.

00:03:38.040 --> 00:03:39.330
Hybrid?

00:03:39.330 --> 00:03:40.410
Don't you know?

00:03:40.410 --> 00:03:42.910
They're called genetically designed pets.

00:03:42.910 --> 00:03:46.450
They're rare species created
by altering DNA or something.

00:03:46.450 --> 00:03:48.410
I see.

00:03:48.410 --> 00:03:52.830
I've heard that some crazy creatures
have been on sale lately.

00:03:52.830 --> 00:03:54.580
They must be pretty popular.

00:03:54.580 --> 00:03:59.040
But, there isn't much difference,
whether they're real or created.

00:03:59.040 --> 00:04:00.120
What do you mean?

00:04:00.120 --> 00:04:07.120
I mean, there's always been selective
breeding of animals for certain traits.

00:04:07.120 --> 00:04:10.660
Good point!

00:04:07.120 --> 00:04:10.660
For the convenience of humans, huh?

00:04:10.660 --> 00:04:14.830
At this rate, a human and pet
hybrid might be created.

00:04:14.830 --> 00:04:16.290
Like a real bunny girl!

00:04:16.290 --> 00:04:17.950
Whoa! Creepy!

00:04:27.450 --> 00:04:28.620
How's that?

00:04:28.620 --> 00:04:30.370
It'll get blown away by the wind.

00:04:30.370 --> 00:04:32.700
Guess we should make
a better one next time.

00:04:32.700 --> 00:04:34.790
You guys are here again?

00:04:34.790 --> 00:04:36.830
What are you guys doing?

00:04:36.830 --> 00:04:41.000
Hey, Belo. What are their names?

00:04:41.000 --> 00:04:42.120
They don't have any.

00:04:42.120 --> 00:04:45.580
Then, let's think of names for them!

00:04:45.580 --> 00:04:47.160
You guys...

00:04:49.250 --> 00:04:52.200
Oh, crap! I gotta get home soon.

00:04:52.200 --> 00:04:53.330
Me, too.

00:04:53.330 --> 00:04:55.410
It's already that late?

00:04:55.410 --> 00:05:00.450
Then, let's think of names and meet back
here around the same time tomorrow!

00:05:00.450 --> 00:05:03.370
Like I said, why are you guys...

00:05:04.370 --> 00:05:06.370
Got it, Belo?!

00:05:06.370 --> 00:05:08.580
Don't forget the tools
for making the dog house!

00:05:08.580 --> 00:05:11.120
I'll bring food!

00:05:16.080 --> 00:05:19.750
With this, I hope we can all hang out
with Belo like we did before.

00:05:19.750 --> 00:05:21.500
Well, I'm sure it'll be fine.

00:05:21.500 --> 00:05:22.450
Yeah...

00:05:22.450 --> 00:05:24.120
What?

00:05:24.120 --> 00:05:25.290
I forgot.

00:05:25.290 --> 00:05:28.160
I brought some leftovers for them.

00:05:28.160 --> 00:05:29.660
I'll go and feed them real quick.

00:05:29.660 --> 00:05:30.580
What about you, Maaya?

00:05:30.580 --> 00:05:35.080
I have to buy alcohol and go home
or Dad will hit me again...

00:05:35.080 --> 00:05:37.580
As usual, sounds pretty tough.

00:05:37.580 --> 00:05:40.700
Your place isn't much different.

00:05:40.700 --> 00:05:42.040
True.

00:06:06.910 --> 00:06:08.500
Shut up!

00:06:19.000 --> 00:06:21.330
I'll bring some tomorrow, too.

00:06:25.790 --> 00:06:27.580
Huh? Hey!

00:06:32.540 --> 00:06:34.870
What's wrong with you all of a sudden?

00:06:39.620 --> 00:06:41.620
Found you.

00:06:52.790 --> 00:06:54.580
This isn't it.

00:06:56.500 --> 00:07:01.540
This, either. Or this. This, too.

00:07:28.540 --> 00:07:32.450
Do grizzlies also appear in Outside nowadays?

00:07:32.450 --> 00:07:34.040
What did you just say?

00:07:34.040 --> 00:07:37.120
Grizzlies. Big grey bears.

00:07:37.120 --> 00:07:39.250
Why did you think that?

00:07:39.250 --> 00:07:42.870
There was a similar accident
at a national park when I was a kid.

00:07:42.870 --> 00:07:45.290
The injuries look similar.

00:07:45.290 --> 00:07:46.700
Find anything?

00:07:46.700 --> 00:07:50.910
It looks like the weapon
wasn't a gun or a blade.

00:07:50.910 --> 00:07:55.330
It looks like the victim was slashed apart
by a pointed but unsharpened object.

00:07:55.330 --> 00:07:56.660
For example?

00:07:56.660 --> 00:08:01.080
Well... possibly the claws
or fangs of a large animal.

00:08:01.080 --> 00:08:03.700
Like a grizzly bear.

00:08:04.790 --> 00:08:06.830
Woods.

00:08:06.830 --> 00:08:09.330
Sorry. That was rude of me.

00:08:19.040 --> 00:08:22.000
Is Belo going out tonight, too?

00:08:22.000 --> 00:08:23.660
It seems so.

00:08:30.160 --> 00:08:32.950
Does it worry you?

00:08:32.950 --> 00:08:35.000
Well, not really...

00:08:51.450 --> 00:08:53.580
Dave...

00:08:53.580 --> 00:08:55.160
He hasn't come home?

00:08:55.160 --> 00:08:58.370
Yeah. Ever since we separated.

00:08:58.370 --> 00:09:01.540
Got it. Leave it to me.

00:09:09.330 --> 00:09:11.120
He isn't here, either.

00:09:15.790 --> 00:09:18.620
I wonder if Dad's already home...

00:09:50.700 --> 00:09:52.950
Wh-Who's there?!

00:10:07.000 --> 00:10:11.290
Noo!

00:10:36.370 --> 00:10:37.950
Found him.

00:11:10.700 --> 00:11:11.790
Run!

00:11:12.790 --> 00:11:14.000
Hurry!

00:11:21.910 --> 00:11:23.120
Whistle?

00:11:27.540 --> 00:11:28.750
Wait!

00:11:34.830 --> 00:11:37.870
You stupid dog!

00:11:37.870 --> 00:11:41.450
You didn't get any material today, either?!

00:11:45.750 --> 00:11:49.500
It seemed like such a good idea
to stick a human and a dog together...

00:11:49.500 --> 00:11:53.410
Dammit. What a waste of my time.

00:11:53.410 --> 00:11:55.580
Got it? You better do it right this time.

00:11:55.580 --> 00:11:57.620
Stick together?

00:11:57.620 --> 00:11:59.250
Who the hell is this kid?

00:11:59.250 --> 00:12:04.950
Answer me. Did you just say you
stuck a human and dog together?

00:12:04.950 --> 00:12:06.750
He'll be perfect material.

00:12:06.750 --> 00:12:08.870
Hey. Shitty dog. Get him!

00:12:19.330 --> 00:12:22.580
It can't be. Those clothes...!

00:12:24.620 --> 00:12:26.500
Don't kill him! You better not kill him!

00:12:26.500 --> 00:12:29.660
I'm going to stick him together
with you like that other kid!

00:12:29.660 --> 00:12:33.540
So, it's true?! Are you really Dave?!

00:12:43.500 --> 00:12:45.660
M-Monster?!

00:12:45.660 --> 00:12:47.250
What the hell?!

00:12:47.250 --> 00:12:48.540
Wait!

00:13:00.790 --> 00:13:03.250
Are you really Dave?!

00:13:05.410 --> 00:13:09.000
So that man did something to you?!

00:13:09.000 --> 00:13:10.540
Am I right?!

00:13:11.620 --> 00:13:13.160
Shit!

00:13:13.160 --> 00:13:15.040
Stop! Dave!

00:13:16.040 --> 00:13:17.410
Dammit!

00:13:20.580 --> 00:13:23.870
Stop! Can't you tell who I am, Dave?!

00:13:25.620 --> 00:13:29.790
The signal to his smart phone
disappeared around here...

00:13:35.950 --> 00:13:39.290
Daryl?! Why is he here?!

00:13:39.290 --> 00:13:42.700
Two monsters!

00:13:48.790 --> 00:13:50.370
Dave! You can't!

00:13:58.830 --> 00:14:00.830
Stop! Stop it!

00:14:00.830 --> 00:14:04.040
Dave... Please...

00:14:07.410 --> 00:14:08.450
Dave!

00:14:30.160 --> 00:14:34.040
I don't want to see you like this...

00:14:35.910 --> 00:14:39.910
What the hell? What is going on?

00:14:39.910 --> 00:14:41.450
You're...

00:14:44.370 --> 00:14:45.910
Wait!

00:14:45.910 --> 00:14:48.950
I was wrong about you!

00:14:48.950 --> 00:14:53.870
You saved me from those
monsters just now, right?!

00:14:55.870 --> 00:14:58.620
Yes. That's how it was!

00:14:58.620 --> 00:15:00.290
That's what I thought!

00:15:00.290 --> 00:15:02.620
I was looking for you this whole time!

00:15:02.620 --> 00:15:04.790
I really wanted to see you!

00:15:04.790 --> 00:15:06.200
See me?

00:15:06.200 --> 00:15:09.450
Yeah! That's right! Because you're...!

00:15:12.120 --> 00:15:13.700
Daryl?

00:15:19.290 --> 00:15:22.580
Die! Die! This is revenge for my father!

00:15:22.580 --> 00:15:26.830
Die! Die! Die! Die! Die!
Die! Die! Die! Die!

00:15:37.830 --> 00:15:39.830
That's what I thought...

00:15:41.200 --> 00:15:45.040
What the hell are you?

00:16:04.950 --> 00:16:06.000
Shit!

00:16:22.410 --> 00:16:24.370
Looks like it's not coming back.

00:16:29.950 --> 00:16:32.910
Well, that's fine. It was a shitty dog.

00:16:32.910 --> 00:16:35.500
I can't even sell something
like that to maniac collectors.

00:16:35.500 --> 00:16:38.700
I have to make something a little better.

00:16:38.700 --> 00:16:41.580
What should I try next?

00:16:41.580 --> 00:16:45.620
I'll make a new species and sell it.

00:16:45.620 --> 00:16:50.330
Maybe I should try mixing a human
and a cat together this time...

00:16:50.330 --> 00:16:53.500
So, you modified Dave like that.

00:16:59.250 --> 00:17:01.500
H-How'd you find me?!

00:17:01.500 --> 00:17:05.750
That sound. It was a dog whistle, right?

00:17:05.750 --> 00:17:09.790
Sorry. I have pretty good ears.

00:17:09.790 --> 00:17:11.410
This brat...

00:17:20.910 --> 00:17:22.950
They're like us.

00:17:22.950 --> 00:17:23.830
Huh?!

00:17:23.830 --> 00:17:26.500
Strays that have nowhere to go.

00:17:26.500 --> 00:17:30.160
So, what's wrong with humans
doing what we want with them?!

00:17:30.160 --> 00:17:32.330
It's what the people want!

00:17:32.330 --> 00:17:34.580
I'm doing this because they're in demand!

00:17:38.040 --> 00:17:39.950
Just die!

00:17:39.950 --> 00:17:43.950
Oh. This again.

00:18:53.830 --> 00:18:55.040
Stop.

00:18:59.080 --> 00:19:02.870
If you kill a human, you won't
be able to become one.

00:19:02.870 --> 00:19:04.870
Do not become a murderer.

00:19:15.370 --> 00:19:16.540
Belo.

00:19:19.700 --> 00:19:28.870
And, we are not the ones to punish him.

00:19:28.870 --> 00:19:33.200
H-Hey. All of you?

00:19:49.450 --> 00:19:52.080
You've calmed down.

00:19:55.620 --> 00:19:57.250
Poor things.

00:19:57.250 --> 00:20:00.330
You were created by the whims of man.

00:20:00.330 --> 00:20:02.040
However...

00:20:02.040 --> 00:20:05.290
There's no longer a cage to lock you down.

00:20:07.250 --> 00:20:09.290
Go and live as you wish.

00:20:37.000 --> 00:20:38.870
According to police's
investigation of the witnesses,

00:20:38.870 --> 00:20:44.500
this pet shop was doing illegal
body modifications to create animals

00:20:44.500 --> 00:20:52.250
similar to the popular genetically
designed pets without proper license.

00:20:52.250 --> 00:20:56.330
The culprit had created
various animals and sold them.

00:20:56.330 --> 00:21:00.200
My, what shabby quality.

00:20:56.330 --> 00:21:00.200
The police continue to look
further into the case.

00:21:08.200 --> 00:21:12.410
Also suspected as the kidnapper
of many young boys and girls,

00:21:12.410 --> 00:21:16.040
he is under heavy investigation.

00:21:16.040 --> 00:21:18.120
What in the world is with this guy?

00:21:18.120 --> 00:21:20.580
What a terrible thing to do, right?

00:21:20.580 --> 00:21:22.160
Right?

00:21:23.250 --> 00:21:25.080
U-Um?!

00:21:25.080 --> 00:21:31.790
This time! I got tickets to this
amazing musical! I-If you're free! Look!

00:21:31.790 --> 00:21:33.580
Where do you want to go today?

00:21:33.580 --> 00:21:35.660
Hm, I want some ice cream!

00:22:00.950 --> 00:22:01.870
Belo!

00:22:01.870 --> 00:22:03.000
Welcome back!

00:22:03.000 --> 00:22:05.790
Belo! We were waiting for you!
